metry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.965919,36.18410309]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"砂沼","category":"nature","address":"湖沼景観 / 湖沼","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"08210","municipality_pref":"茨城県","municipality_name":"下妻市","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"701"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.94955444335938,36.189815521240234]}}],"display_comment_original":"下妻市には、江戸期の下妻藩と下妻陣屋に連なる領主・城下の記憶が残る。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場、城跡や陣屋跡に関わる場所が見え、下妻城跡、大宝城跡、八幡宮のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では城跡・陣屋跡、城廻村、西当郷村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに田・新田・用水の地名が多く、土地改良碑や用水記念碑が見つかる可能性がある。水辺の由緒を示す歴史案内板も見つかるかもしれない。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["飯村丈三郎","龍胆寺雄","北垣信行","横瀬夜雨","市村緑郎"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["砂沼","砂沼サンビーチ","下妻城","大宝城（蹟）（関城・大宝城の戦い）","大宝八幡宮","小貝川ふれあい公園","ビアスパークしもつま","下妻市ふるさと博物館"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":["下妻藩"],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%8B%E5%A6%BB%E5%B8%82","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11666406","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11679345","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11401325","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11543321","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11480510","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q98687953"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"下妻市","wikipedia_revision_id":"110506648","wikidata_qid":"Q533241","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%8B%E5%A6%BB%E5%B8%82","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}